# Shallow courtyard dish with a raised rim. Environment / ground mesh for increment 7.
# Not a box plane. 16-gon floor + inner wall + rim top + outer skirt.
# 81 vertices, 144 triangles, per-face UVs (vt + f v/vt).
# Physics uses trimesh so props can rest on the floor and against the lip.
